Americans shouldn't have to wait for a tragedy before the law is enforced.

Worksite enforcement is one of the most effective ways to deter illegal immigration and ensure those here unlawfully are held accountable.

@lora_ries is Director of the Border Security and Immigration Center at The Heritage Foundation.

